{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636730/extras/27ecd76189f04a59a6236fe19bf7c05f.poster.avif?t=1756109712\" width=800 height=458 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636730/extras/27ecd76189f04a59a6236fe19bf7c05f.webm?t=1756109712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636730/extras/27ecd76189f04a59a6236fe19bf7c05f.mp4?t=1756109712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seedovia is an action rogue-like dungeon crawler where you create and discover combinations with your weapons (a.k.a. Seeds) by chaining them together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636730/extras/228a2c3f6f02a01c024f15bd2d818575.poster.avif?t=1756109712\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636730/extras/228a2c3f6f02a01c024f15bd2d818575.webm?t=1756109712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636730/extras/228a2c3f6f02a01c024f15bd2d818575.mp4?t=1756109712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Create unique seed combinations</i>: Discover many different seeds and chain them together to create your own chaos. There are hundreds of different combinations for you to try.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Powerful talismans and passive upgrades</i>: Talismans and passive upgrades can be found during your endeavour. Finding these items can provide great benefits to your build.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fight room after room</i>: Engage in combat, earn your reward, and move on to the next room. The rooms you enter are chosen at random, so you will never experience the same run twice.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636730/extras/b126cac63b6bffe83bcf5d0ce30bfc12.poster.avif?t=1756109712\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636730/extras/b126cac63b6bffe83bcf5d0ce30bfc12.webm?t=1756109712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636730/extras/b126cac63b6bffe83bcf5d0ce30bfc12.mp4?t=1756109712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Death","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3636730/a08d0d2c5b74bf842e6c11a043c57c27fa00f43f.jpg"},{"name":"Swift","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3636730/2d38bd31520ef31664d1de5eed6ca9fa8dab10dd.jpg"},{"name":"PIZZA!!!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3636730/cb97d2bfd72c6df441337d0acc67eb5306f7c9f7.jpg"},{"name":"I'm Rich!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3636730/4a373877a6dbf3b426eab42a2e3046510149b853.jpg"},{"name":"Healthy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3636730/b9b56533c32ab460bfa4a7e52bc7729055190cf0.jpg"},{"name":"Vea Pea","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3636730/9dbbf83f198ba18ccd0a7e9e29931e1e71e80813.jpg"},{"name":"Blueberry","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3636730/1c271bbe7ae35906ee43a7f4662dd6a1e72f88f2.j